<Base title="Entertainment for Bars & Restaurants | Four Dogs" description="Bring recurring trivia, Music Bingo, and interactive game nights to your South Carolina bar or restaurant with Four Dogs Entertainment."><section class="section dark"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">For bars & restaurants</p><h1>Turn a slow night into a local tradition.</h1><p class="lead">Give customers a reason to put your venue on their weekly calendar.</p><a class="button" href="/booking/?service=Venue%20Entertainment">Ask about a test night</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>Weeknights can be inconsistent.</h2><p>A hosted recurring experience creates a clear answer to “What are we doing Tuesday?” without asking your team to become entertainers.</p></div><img src="/images/hero.jpg" alt="A crowd at a Four Dogs recurring venue night"></div></section><section class="section alt"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">The Four Dogs model</p><h2>Choose the experience. We run the room.</h2><div class="grid">{['Trivia','Music Bingo','Four Dogs Survey Showdown','Are You Smarter Than a Barstool?','Other hosted formats'].map(x=><div class="card"><h3>{x}</h3></div>)}</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container grid"><div><h2>Four Dogs handles</h2><ul><li>The host and game</li><li>Pacing and game materials</li><li>Audio when required</li><li>Promotional creative</li><li>Event and social promotion support</li></ul></div><div><h2>Your venue handles</h2><ul><li>Food and beverages</li><li>Your staff</li><li>Your customers</li><li>The hospitality that makes the room yours</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="section alt"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">A venue owner’s perspective</p><h2>A working partnership, not just another date on the calendar.</h2>{featuredReviews[0] && <ReviewCard review={featuredReviews[0]} excerpt="forVenues" showFull={true} />}</div></section><section class="section dark"><div class="container"><h2>Bring Four Dogs to your venue.</h2><p>No invented promises—just a conversation about the right recurring format for your room.</p><a class="button" href="/booking/?service=Venue%20Entertainment">Ask about a test night</a></div></section></Base>
